title: Read slow sometimes.
pid: 96abb912-1bf0-433d-9987-f4569757cebb
body: |2-
  Languidly reviewing at a collection of poorly-understood ideas,
  maybe with their better-understood neighbors, can generate insight.
  Or simpply feel good, like attending a church you believe in.
  (Implication: delete, or at least bury in unopened subfolder notes,
  things you don't believe in.)
